<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <partial name="_Breadcrumbs" />
        <h1>Off-site backups</h1>
        <p class="lead">A backup that lives on the same server as the database is not a backup plan. Copy every SQL Server backup to a NAS, Amazon S3, Azure Blob Storage, an SFTP server or Google Drive &mdash; automatically.</p>
    </div>
</section>

